&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;
	&lt;span style=&quot;border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;At the time of the visit, our documented food safety procedures were not being consistently followed in practice. Since then, we have taken immediate and comprehensive corrective action, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; direction: ltr; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;
		Retraining all staff on food hygiene, personal hygiene, cross-contamination control, stock rotation and record keeping&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; direction: ltr; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;
		Strengthening management supervision and daily checks&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; direction: ltr; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;
		Reviewing and updating our food safety management system to ensure it is clear, practical and fully implemented&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; direction: ltr; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;
		Improving date labelling, shelf-life control, stock control and monitoring records&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; direction: ltr; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;
		Introducing stricter verification procedures to ensure standards are maintained at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
